keywords:
  - multiple-choice exams
  - optical mark recognition
  - automated grading
  - personalised assessment
  - education
abstract: >-
  Aspa is a local web application to generate, print, read and grade multiple-choice
  exams. It produces answer sheets with fiducial markers and QR codes, reads scans or
  mobile-phone photos with computer vision, grades them (including partial credit and
  personalised exams that exclude questions already passed in class) and supports
  reviewing each exam with the student.
